{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Den, an unlucky door salesman, is sent from Samara to Voronezh on his boss's orders. But his life turns upside down when he discovers a suitcase full of cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/1.gif?t=1751660823\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cDEATH TRAIN!!! Samara \u2013 Voronezh.\u201d is an absurd comedic thriller. A kinetic novel about the dark side of freedom, trains, money, strong-willed people... and bears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A gripping story lasting 1\u20132 hours of reading.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 vivid characters whose stories intertwine on a single ill-fated train.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 10 memorable musical compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 70 illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A second door as a gift! (Just kidding. This isn't charity.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/extras/2.gif?t=1751660823\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3762650?t=1751660823","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/78b8b060158efefbe14959f02a6efbe56051fef3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751660823","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/b062906069c74382b013c6faafe3215cda231ca4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751660823","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762650/b062906069c74382b013c6faafe3215cda231ca4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751